{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1170878431"}, "name":{"label":"Guy The Guy4444"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-22T08:41:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0"}, "id":{"label":"13047597676"}, "title":{"label":"Hi."}, "content":{"label":"Hello, Absolutelynoname8055 here (my Roblox username) I like this game. A lot. This was the first game I ever got, back when I was 1/2. 8 years later I still enjoy the game. For some reason I only play it on my grandmas iPad Air. My iPad Air hasn’t played this game for a while. When the solar coloring thing was released, I played it a lot. Doing stuff like the history of the solar star system, and that’s it. After I went through a divorce, I started liking the titanic. I don’t remember it in the game though. But even though I don’t play this game that much, it’s always nostalgic for me 😁. Keep up the good work!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1378467217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
