{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1696560448"}, "name":{"label":"Fhdjnedijs"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-12T20:41:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0"}, "id":{"label":"13009208836"}, "title":{"label":"Love/hate"}, "content":{"label":"I love that the letters & letter sounds lessons are interactive. But I’m really confused as to why it goes through different letters & letter sounds while working on a specific letter. For example, when working on “uppercase B”, it will ask you to find the “B”, but then on the next screen it asks you to find the letter “M”, and finally it asks you to find the letter “B” again. My daughter gets so confused because we haven’t worked on a letter that it’s asking her about. Weird. I wish the videos & interactive stuff would focus on JUST that topic & not jump around.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1378467217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
