{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id420402772"}, "name":{"label":"Gamer heath"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-12T06:46:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0"}, "id":{"label":"13006956039"}, "title":{"label":"Best kids app EVER"}, "content":{"label":"I have downloaded PLENTY of apps to keep my kids entertained on roadtrips or when mom just needs a minute. Every other app says “free” but then has pop ups that force you to pay for extra. Not khan academy kids! It’s 100% free and my kids learn so much! It’s quite literally the best app for kids! \n\nWe just started homeschooling my 3 year old and 5 year old and I love the books because it helps teach critical thinking and asks questions about the story that was just read. \n\nIf you’re looking for a HIGH quality app for your kids, this is it!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1378467217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
